\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ona iyman ederler - ya'ni dini islâmı tasdık ederler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 192.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 19.4 26.2 33.7 33.7 45.7 50.2 57.7 73.4 84.0 84.0 99.7 99.7 106.4 106.4 122.2 122.2 129.7 129.7 136.4 136.4 148.4 164.2 164.2 174.7 181.4\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"26.2 45.7 73.4 148.4 174.7 181.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve muhtelif hızıblerden - fırkalardan - her kim buna küfrederse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"124\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 124.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 41.2 41.2 49.4 65.2 65.2 73.4 80.2 80.2 87.0 94.4 101.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"49.4 80.2 101.2 108.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onun da mev'ud yeri ateştir. - <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 176.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 45.7 45.7 52.6 59.3 59.3 66.7 66.7 82.6 93.7 93.7 109.6 109.6 126.0 141.7 153.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"52.6 126.0 147.0 153.7 160.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> binaenaleyh bunda, bu kitabda hiç şüphen olmasın <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"241\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 241.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.0 42.0 48.7 48.7 48.7 57.0 57.0 72.7 93.7 108.7 115.4 115.4 122.2 129.7 145.4 153.0 159.7 159.7 171.0 186.7 186.7 197.2 197.2 209.2 209.2 216.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 2